          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Indications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The PeriPRO Femur Plating System is indicated for internal fixation and stabilization of femur fractures and osteotomies in normal and osteopenic bone. This includes:",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Non-unions, malunions and deformities",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Fracture in the presence of intramedullary implants, including periprosthetic fractures",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Approaches",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Surgeons may use a standard lateral, modified lateral (anterolateral), or lateral parapatellar approach to the distal lateral femur.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Technical specifications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Material: Ti6Al4V ELI (plates and non locking screws) and Cobalt chrome (CoCr alloy locking screws)",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Distal femur plate lengths: 173 - 396mm",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Variable angle locking within a 30° cone",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Left and right anatomic plate options",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Variable Angle Screw Trajectory",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The PeriPRO Distal Femur Plates offer an evidence-based design with a variety of plate lengths, screw diameters and SOMA designed screw trajectories, allowing for the ability to achieve a desired construct.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
